{"id":"psoc4100s","name":"PSoC 4100S / 4100S Plus","vendor":"Infineon","family":"PSoC 4","description":"48 MHz Cortex-M0+ with best-in-class CapSense touch, opamps and a 12-bit SAR ADC, running from 1.71-5.5 V. The 4100S Plus adds 128 KB flash, 5 serial blocks and classic CAN.","core":"Arm Cortex-M0+","arch":"arm","cores":1,"maxMhz":48,"fpu":"none","flashKB":128,"externalFlashMaxMB":0,"ramKB":16,"psramMaxMB":0,"voltage":{"min":1.71,"max":5.5},"supply5V":true,"peripherals":{"gpio":54,"uart":5,"i2c":5,"spi":5,"i2s":0,"can":1,"canFd":0,"usb":0,"usbHost":false,"usbHighSpeed":false,"usbPd":false,"ethernet":0,"sdio":0,"qspi":false,"adcChannels":16,"adcBits":12,"dacChannels":0,"pwmChannels":8,"touchChannels":53,"rtc":false,"lcd":true,"camera":false,"pio":false,"crypto":false},"wireless":{"wifi":"none","wifi5GHz":false,"ble":null,"btClassic":false,"thread":false,"zigbee":false,"matter":false,"subGhz":false,"lora":false,"cellular":"none","nfc":false},"lowPower":{"deepSleepUa":2.5,"activeUaPerMhz":112},"ecosystem":{"arduino":false,"micropython":false,"circuitpython":false,"rust":false,"zephyr":false,"platformio":false,"vendorSdk":"ModusToolbox / PSoC Creator"},"programming":{"usbBootloader":false,"uartBootloader":false,"debug":["SWD"],"needsProgrammer":true},"variants":[{"partNumber":"CY8C4147AZI-S475","package":"TQFP-64","pins":64,"bodyMm":[10,10],"pitchMm":0.5,"leadSpanMm":[12,12],"flashKB":128,"ramKB":16,"gpio":54,"lcsc":"C2959330","priceUsd":6.5,"kicadFootprint":"Package_QFP:TQFP-64_10x10mm_P0.5mm","kicad":{"officialFootprint":{"ref":"Package_QFP:TQFP-64_10x10mm_P0.5mm","url":"https://gitlab.com/api/v4/projects/kicad%2Flibraries%2Fkicad-footprints/repository/files/Package_QFP.pretty%2FTQFP-64_10x10mm_P0.5mm.kicad_mod/raw?ref=a0dcd398e7ea4b00cdeb91efc35f09cceaa9097d"},"generatedFootprint":"TQFP-64_10x10mm_P0.5mm","pinout":false},"buy":[{"store":"LCSC","url":"https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C2959330.html","priceUsd":6.5},{"store":"DigiKey","url":"https://www.digikey.com/en/products/result?keywords=CY8C4147AZI-S475"},{"store":"Mouser","url":"https://www.mouser.com/c/?q=CY8C4147AZI-S475"},{"store":"JLCPCB parts","url":"https://jlcpcb.com/parts/componentSearch?searchTxt=C2959330"},{"store":"Octopart","url":"https://octopart.com/search?q=CY8C4147AZI-S475"}]},{"partNumber":"CY8C4146AZI-S433","package":"TQFP-48","pins":48,"bodyMm":[7,7],"pitchMm":0.5,"leadSpanMm":[9,9],"flashKB":64,"ramKB":8,"gpio":36,"lcsc":"C458125","priceUsd":1.7,"kicadFootprint":"Package_QFP:TQFP-48_7x7mm_P0.5mm","kicad":{"officialFootprint":{"ref":"Package_QFP:TQFP-48_7x7mm_P0.5mm","url":"https://gitlab.com/api/v4/projects/kicad%2Flibraries%2Fkicad-footprints/repository/files/Package_QFP.pretty%2FTQFP-48_7x7mm_P0.5mm.kicad_mod/raw?ref=a0dcd398e7ea4b00cdeb91efc35f09cceaa9097d"},"generatedFootprint":"TQFP-48_7x7mm_P0.5mm","pinout":false},"buy":[{"store":"LCSC","url":"https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C458125.html","priceUsd":1.7},{"store":"DigiKey","url":"https://www.digikey.com/en/products/result?keywords=CY8C4146AZI-S433"},{"store":"Mouser","url":"https://www.mouser.com/c/?q=CY8C4146AZI-S433"},{"store":"JLCPCB parts","url":"https://jlcpcb.com/parts/componentSearch?searchTxt=C458125"},{"store":"Octopart","url":"https://octopart.com/search?q=CY8C4146AZI-S433"}]}],"released":2016,"status":"active","datasheetUrl":"https://www.infineon.com/dgdl/Infineon-PSOC_4_PSOC_4100S_PLUS_DATASHEET_PROGRAMMABLE_SYSTEM-ON-CHIP_(PSOC)-DataSheet-v12_00-EN.pdf?fileId=8ac78c8c7d0d8da4017d0ee556d86cff","productUrl":"https://www.infineon.com/products/microcontroller/32-bit-psoc-arm-cortex/psoc-4-mcu/4100/psoc-4100s-plus","notes":["Serial ports come from SCBs that are each I2C, SPI or UART at runtime: 5 on the 4100S Plus, 3 on the 4100S. The uart/i2c/spi counts are per-type maxima and share the same blocks.","CAN is classic CAN 2.0B (no FD) and only on 4100S Plus parts with a 6 or 7 in the suffix (e.g. -S465, -S475). CapSense needs a 5 or 7 there (e.g. -S455, -S475), and plain 4100S parts with -S43x have CapSense.","Runs directly from 1.71-5.5 V, so 5 V systems need no regulator.","There is no hardware calendar RTC. The WCO 32 kHz crystal plus watchdog counters are used for timekeeping in firmware.","The two 7-bit IDACs are current DACs, mainly for CapSense, and there is no voltage DAC. Also on chip: 2 opamps (CTBm), 2 low-power comparators and Smart I/O logic (no UDBs).","The 4100S Plus has a TRNG but no crypto accelerator.","There is no ROM bootloader, so blank chips are programmed over SWD (KitProg3/MiniProg4). A bootloader can be added in firmware.","CapSense works on any GPIO except the CMOD capacitor pin, so touchChannels is the GPIO count minus one.","The SAR ADC sequencer has 16 single-ended channels via the AMUX bus. The 4100S (non-Plus) has 64 KB flash, 8 KB SRAM, 5 TCPWMs and up to 36 GPIO.","The larger PSoC 4100S Plus 256 KB (CY8C4148) and 4100S Max (CY8C4149) are separate lines and are not included here."],"sources":["https://www.infineon.com/dgdl/Infineon-PSOC_4_PSOC_4100S_PLUS_DATASHEET_PROGRAMMABLE_SYSTEM-ON-CHIP_(PSOC)-DataSheet-v12_00-EN.pdf?fileId=8ac78c8c7d0d8da4017d0ee556d86cff","https://www.infineon.com/dgdl/Infineon-PSOC_4_PSOC_4100S_DATASHEET_PROGRAMMABLE_SYSTEM-ON-CHIP_(PSOC)-DataSheet-v17_00-EN.pdf?fileId=8ac78c8c7d0d8da4017d0eda5fc45c69","https://www.infineon.com/part/CY8C4147AZI-S475","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C2959330.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C458125.html","https://www.findchips.com/search/CY8C4147AZI-S475"],"boards":[]}